High-Level Architecture (MVC + Dual Interface)
-----------------------------------------------

The backend serves two interfaces from a single codebase:

  Mobile App (React Native)  --- JSON --->  API Routes (api/v1/*)
                                              |
  Web Admin Panel (Browser)  --- HTML --->  Web Routes (/admin/*, /organization/*)
                                              |
                                         +----+----+
                                         | Laravel  |
                                         |  Core    |
                                         +----+----+
                                              |
               +------------------------------+------------------------------+
               |                              |                              |
         Controllers                       Models (13)                 Views (60+)
     (Api/, Web/Admin/,               (Eloquent ORM)               (Blade templates)
      Web/Organization/,              + Relationships
      Auth/)                          + SoftDeletes
      + Traits                        + Spatie traits


Three-Persona Design
--------------------

  Persona             | Role            | Interface  | Auth Method
  --------------------|-----------------|------------|------------------------
  Public User         | public_user     | Mobile App | Sanctum token (auth:sanctum)
  Organization Admin  | organization    | Web Panel  | Session (auth) + role check
  System Admin        | super_admin     | Web Panel  | Session (auth) + role check

Middleware chain: auth -> is_active (custom, blocks inactive accounts) -> Spatie role:xxx


