Key Design Decisions
--------------------

  1. Dual-Interface
     Single Laravel backend serves both JSON REST API (mobile)
     and Blade-rendered HTML (web admin panels)

  2. API Versioning
     All mobile routes prefixed with api/v1/

  3. Multi-Step Org Registration
     Atomic transaction: create User + Organization (status: pending)
     + upload registration documents via MediaLibrary -> admin approves/rejects

  4. OTP Verification
     6-digit email OTP cached for 10 min (60s cooldown), replaces
     traditional email verification links for mobile users

  5. Auto QR Codes
     Each pet gets a unique RQN-XXXXX QR ID auto-generated on model
     creating event

  6. Soft Deletes
     All major entities use SoftDeletes for audit trail; financial
     records use SET NULL to preserve history

  7. Nepal-Specific
     Fields for Nepal NGO registration numbers, Khalti/eSewa payment
     gateways, local address tracking

  8. Spatie RBAC
     Three roles (public_user, organization, super_admin) with room
     for granular permissions

  9. CORS
     Open CORS config (api/* + sanctum, all origins/methods) for
     mobile app access


